{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1151663-how-much-have-you-used-the-astral","id":1151663,"title":"How much have you used the Astral?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Mage: The Awakening"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-10-21T09:54:24-07:00","id":1151663,"title":"How much have you used the Astral?","content":"How much astral adventuring do your groups do? When I ran 1 ed years ago I never really used it much. Have your groups done much dream adventuring?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12662-bestial-warlust","name":"bestial Warlust","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"60"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-21T10:24:00-07:00","id":1151672,"title":"","content":"I wish I could be in a large group that used it regularly, but its probably best for very small groups, or one-on-one sessions. I've played with a few people before, but they've all only played one-on-one so far, I've never gotten to play in an actual group.<br /> <br /> With that said... Astral has come up a lot, and has been very interesting. My player has always enjoyed his excursions into the Astral. Made such a big impact that when his character, who was working on a Life-based legacy or trying to find a way to join the orphans of proteus, met a Dreamspeaker? Decided to pursue the Dreamspeaker legacy so that his character could be in the astral at all times.<br /> <br /> But I have got to say. How can a game eventually <i>not</i> include a high-level-but-high-stakes visit to an Aeon? The only person I've played with who didn't love occassional visits to the Astral hated any other-world excursion--didn't like the Shadow, didn't like the Astral, didn't even like going into the Hedge or fleshing it out in Changeling.<br /> The others though very much enjoyed visiting the Aeons at least once, with one of my player-friends visiting the Aeons more than once (and accepting/suffering detrimental effects for doing so) just for the pleasure of being menaced by the likes of Dahhak, or the dangerous allure of Glorianna.<br /> <br /> Reasons to possibly include the astral might be--to learn a legacy through a soul stone, perhaps in a broken, falling apart onieros adventure; the setting has a strong astral presence like the 2E gamebooks sample setting in, what was it, Los Angeles or San-Fran? One of those.<br /> <br /> Or your setting might just hold its Consiliums in the Temenos because it is safer or easier in that specific town--probably advantageous if you include a strong presence of witch-finders in your story.<br /> <br /> And of course the Free-Councilers and Seers both looove tampering with the Astral so, story-hooks with that.<br /> <br /> But even as much as I love the Astral, if your games are safely anchored in conventional reality there's nothing wrong with that. It just meant your players had nothing distracting them I guess? If you have nothing major planned that uses the Astral then it would probably only come up for use in down-time, or when too many people can't make it but some people still want to play Mage for a little bit.<br /> <br /> I think the Astral sort of requires that using it gets a lot more personal with your players and their characters, but if that's something your troupe wants and can do, then the Astral is a great resource for getting into more personal details like character arcs and such. I definitely recommend it if it gets a good, worthy opportunity for usage!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7967-scarlet-witch","name":"Scarlet Witch","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7967_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"498"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-21T10:36:39-07:00","id":1151674,"title":"","content":"I think for me that's the issue with astral adventuring it seems to be a better fit for one player. It seems less useful I know in Boston Unveiled there is the schooner. I do like the idea of holding a consilium in the Temenos that would be an interesting twist.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12662-bestial-warlust","name":"bestial Warlust","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"60"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-21T10:53:12-07:00","id":1151683,"title":"","content":"I have a friend that uses the Astral regularly for his group. He really loves that mindscape stuff. We had a game where all the PCs had some very specific amnesia and needed to do a lot of Astral investigation to figure out why.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2632-mrmdubois","name":"Mrmdubois","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6827"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-21T13:03:51-07:00","id":1151719,"title":"","content":"I've tried, seeded a lot of hooks to it, but so far they've seemed more interested in the physical world. We've had games with abundant Hedge and Shadow exploration and Skein-walking, it's possible they just got tired of it.<br /> <br /> I suppose it helps that there's no Mastigos.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-21T15:56:14-07:00","id":1151777,"title":"","content":"In my 1e campaign the PC's travelled into the astral to visit a Aeon to ask for help. Got to do the tour of the astral right up to the shores of the abyss and the aeon towers. It was a long campaign so they also got a tour of the underworld and spent time in the hedge and shadowlands too. I tried very hard to make each place feel different, and because travelling in the temenos is via association etc once the players understood it they had great fun with it.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1534,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1534-totalgit","user":"totalgit","date":". 10-21-2017, 07:01 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1534-totalgit","name":"totalgit","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1534_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"742"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-22T17:19:55-07:00","id":1152066,"title":"","content":"Here's some Astral AP stuff from my game.<br /> <br /> This one has a Temenos journey: <a href=\"http://mage-doomcrew.obsidianportal.com/adventure-log/kronate-session-two\" target=\"_blank\">http://mage-doomcrew.obsidianportal....te-session-two</a><br /> <br /> This one has an Oneiros journey: <a href=\"http://mage-doomcrew.obsidianportal.com/adventure-log/arachne-session-two\" target=\"_blank\">http://mage-doomcrew.obsidianportal....ne-session-two</a>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1470-johnny-awesome","name":"Johnny Awesome","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1470_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"447"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}